<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss June trade figures due Wednesday.</title>
<headline>Swiss June trade figures due Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss provisional import and export figures for June will be released on July 16 at 0815 (0615 GMT), the Federal Customs Office said.</p>
<p>Revised figures for May showed a surplus of 366.2 million Swiss francs on imports of 7,815.5 million and exports of 8,181.8 million Swiss francs.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
</text>
